# impeccable-ignore-start
# Ephemeral output, runtime state, and per-developer overrides.
# Shared artifacts such as config.json, design.json and critique/*.md stay tracked.
.impeccable/config.local.json
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
.impeccable/hook.pending.json
